OL,3,GNEWSAMotorist caught driving car with
OL,4,Amissing tyre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorist was arrested after catching
OL,7,Fthe attention of police officers by
OL,8,Fdriving a car with only three tyres.
OL,10,FEssex Police officers were on patrol
OL,11,Fclose to the Generals Lane roundabout
OL,12,Fin Chelmsford on Friday when they heard
OL,13,Fa "loud, metal grinding noise".
OL,15,FAfter stopping the vehicle in Beaulieu
OL,16,FParkway, they found it had "been driven
OL,17,Ffor some time" with one of its wheels
OL,18,Fmissing a tyre.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
